  "instructions": [
    "1. Grill the chicken breast until cooked, then slice into thin strips.",
    "2. Slice the morcilla into rounds.",
    "3. In a blender, combine coconut milk, peanut butter, chili flakes, and coriander. Blend until smooth.",
    "4. Add lime juice to the peanut sauce and stir well.",
    "5. Grill the sliced chicken and morcilla until slightly charred.",
    "6. Serve the grilled chicken and morcilla with the peanut sauce.",
    "7. Garnish with chopped peanuts."
